; The dotnet new templates package (Daml.Templates), which the VSIX carries in its Templates folder:
; Visual Studio's template engine lists its project templates in the New Project dialog.
; $PackageFolder$ is the folder of this pkgdef, which is where the package sits too.
[$RootKey$\TemplateEngine\Templates\DamlTemplates]
"InstalledPath"="$PackageFolder$"
